			description: ["The &6UIV Circuit Assembler&r puts the UIV components and the controllers of this era together from the circuits on this page. A UIV hull and UIV components, and the cleanroom you already run. The parts and hatches on the next two quests, and every controller past the UIV hull. Boards and chips come from the cleanroom by ME; stock what it returns."]
